        "texts": {
          "293": "May 6, 2024 | Caring Hearts and Refreshing Sips: National Nurses Day and National Beverage Day  \nJoin us on May 6, 2024, for a heartfelt tribute to compassion and refreshment as Destination Celebration commemorates National Nurses Day and National Beverage Day. We express our deepest gratitude to the dedicated nurses who tirelessly care for others, providing comfort and healing with their compassion and expertise. Raise a glass in celebration of these healthcare heroes, and indulge in your favorite beverages as we toast to their invaluable contributions. Hosts Marlo Anderson and Latoya Johnson invite you to join us in honoring nurses and enjoying the simple pleasures of a refreshing beverage on Destination Celebration.  \nMORE  \nS2E106 - 2m - May 6, 2024  \nMay 5, 2024 | Fiesta in Space: Cinco de Mayo and Astronaut Day  \nOn May 5, 2024, Destination Celebration invites you to join a dual celebration of courage and exploration as we commemorate Cinco de Mayo and National Astronaut Day. Delve into the rich cultural heritage of Mexico with vibrant festivities, traditional music, and mouthwatering cuisine, honoring the historic Battle of Puebla. Then, set your sights on the stars as we pay tribute to the brave men and women who have ventured beyond Earth's bounds, expanding humanity's reach into the cosmos. Hosts Marlo Anderson and Latoya Johnson invite you to embark on this inspiring journey of celebration and exploration on Destination Celebration.  \nMORE  \nS2E106 - 2m - May 5, 2024  \nMay 4, 2024 | Uniting Fans: Free Comic Book Day and National Star Wars Day  \nOn May 4, 2024, Destination Celebration invites fans of all ages to embark on an adventure through the pages of comics and the galaxy far, far away as we celebrate Free Comic Book Day and National Star Wars Day. Immerse yourself in the vibrant world of comics, where heroes and villains come to life in colorful panels. Then, join the ranks of Jedi and Sith as we honor the iconic Star Wars saga, celebrating the timeless battle between light and dark. Hosts Marlo Anderson and Latoya Johnson invite you to join the festivities, where the Force is strong and the stories are boundless on Destination Celebration.  \nMORE  \nS2E105 - 2m - May 4, 2024  ",
          "294": "May 3, 2024 | Eccentricity and Exploration: Two Different Colored Shoes Day and Space Day  \nOn May 3, 2024, Destination Celebration invites you to embrace individuality and explore the cosmos as we observe Two Different Colored Shoes Day and Space Day. Step into the realm of uniqueness by donning mismatched footwear and celebrate the beauty of being different. Then, embark on a cosmic journey to the stars, as we marvel at the wonders of space exploration and the mysteries of the universe. Join hosts Marlo Anderson and Latoya Johnson as we take a bold stride into the unknown, celebrating diversity and the boundless wonders of the cosmos on Destination Celebration.  \nMORE  \nS2E104 - 2m - May 3, 2024  \nMay 2, 2024 | Indulging in Delicacies: Celebrating National Truffle Day and Salsa Month  \nSavor the exquisite flavors of indulgence and spice on May 2, 2024, as Destination Celebration commemorates National Truffle Day and Salsa Month. Delight in the rich, velvety taste of truffles, as we explore the art of chocolate confectionery and the craftsmanship behind these luxurious treats. Then, ignite your taste buds with the vibrant flavors of salsa, from mild to fiery, as we celebrate the diversity and zest of this beloved condiment. Join hosts Marlo Anderson and Latoya Johnson on a culinary adventure, where we indulge in decadence and embrace the spice of life. Whether you prefer sweet or savory, there's something to tantalize every palate on Destination Celebration.  \nMORE  \nS2E103 - 2m - May 2, 2024  \nMay 1, 2024 | May Flowers and Nursery Rhymes: A May Day and National Mother Goose Day Celebration  ",
          "295": "Step into the whimsical world of May Day and the enchanting tales of Mother Goose on May 1, 2024, as Destination Celebration commemorates May Day and National Mother Goose Day. Experience the joy of May Day festivities, from maypole dances to flower crowns, as we welcome the arrival of spring with open arms. Then, journey into the realm of nursery rhymes and fairy tales, exploring the timeless stories and characters crafted by Mother Goose. Delight in the magic of childhood imagination and celebrate the enduring legacy of these beloved traditions. Hosts Marlo Anderson and Latoya Johnson invite you to join the celebration on Destination Celebration, where we honor the beauty of May and the wonder of storytelling. Let's dance around the maypole and recite our favorite rhymes on Destination Celebration.  \nMORE  \nS2E102 - 2m - May 1, 2024  \nApril 30, 2024 | Curls and Cups: Hairstylist & Bubble Tea Day Festivities  \nGet ready for a day of style and refreshment on April 30, 2024, as Destination Celebration honors National Hairstylist Day and National Bubble Tea Day. Join us as we celebrate the talented hairstylists who keep us looking our best and indulge in the delightful bubble tea craze sweeping the nation. Discover the latest hair trends and tips for maintaining your locks, while also learning about the origins and flavors of bubble tea. Hosts Marlo Anderson and Latoya Johnson invite you to join the celebration on Destination Celebration, where we raise a toast to hairstylists and savor the deliciousness of bubble tea. Let's raise our glasses and salute the hairstylists while enjoying the unique flavors of bubble tea on Destination Celebration.  \nMORE  \nS2E111 - 2m - Apr 30, 2024  \nApril 29, 2024 | A Fusion of Fun and Movement  ",
          "296": "Get ready to laugh and dance on April 29, 2024, as Destination Celebration commemorates National Humor Month and International Dance Day. Join us for a blend of laughter and movement, as we explore the importance of humor in our lives and celebrate the joy of dance. Delve into the world of comedy, discovering the healing power of laughter and the art of a well-timed joke. Then, groove to the rhythm of dance, embracing the expressive and transformative nature of movement. Hosts Marlo Anderson and Latoya Johnson invite you to join the festivities on Destination Celebration, where we celebrate laughter, dance, and the joy of being alive. Let's share a laugh and hit the dance floor together on Destination Celebration.  \nMORE  \nS2E110 - 2m - Apr 29, 2024  \nApril 28, 2024 | Superhero Feats and Blueberry Treats  \nJoin us on April 28, 2024, for a heroic celebration as Destination Celebration honors National Superhero Day and the onset of Blueberry Pie Month. Dive into the world of superheroes, exploring their courage and resilience in the face of adversity. Then, indulge in the delectable sweetness of blueberry pie, savoring each bite of its fruity goodness. Hosts Marlo Anderson and Latoya Johnson invite you to join the festivities on Destination Celebration, where we celebrate the hero within and the delightful flavors of blueberry pie. Let's unite for a superpowered celebration on Destination Celebration.  \nMORE  \nS2E109 - 2m - Apr 28, 2024  \nApril 27, 2024 | Sweet Tales and Chewy Delights: National Gummi Bear Day & Tell A Story Day  \nOn April 27, 2024, immerse yourself in a world of sweetness and imagination as Destination Celebration commemorates National Gummi Bear Day and National Tell A Story Day. Indulge in the chewy delights of gummi bears, savoring their fruity flavors and playful shapes. Then, let your imagination take flight as we celebrate the art of storytelling, sharing tales that captivate and inspire. Join hosts Marlo Anderson and Latoya Johnson as they weave together a tapestry of sweetness and narrative wonder on Destination Celebration. Let's dive into a world of gummi adventures and storytelling magic on Destination Celebration.  \nMORE  "
