          "https://www.louiseleverett.com/lifestyle/janet-oldroyd-hulme-and-yorkshire-forced-rhubarb"
        ],
        "anchor": "Janet Oldroyd Hulme and 'Yorkshire Forced Rhubarb'.",
        "link_score": null,
