        "information": "Source: https://www.instagram.com/popular/the-damingos-band-interview-newspaper-1974/\nTitle: The Damingos Band Interview Newspaper 1974\nChunks: 0,1,2,3,4,5\n# The Damingos Band Interview Newspaper 1974\nLog In\nSign Up\nWatch reels about the damingos band interview newspaper 1974 from people around the world.\n[[](https://www.instagram.com/phoebestreetlive) phoebestreetlive 3,386 Good morning! I’m thrilled to share episode three of Phoebe St LIVE with you today featuring up and coming Canadian power pop rockers Altered By Mom. A trio that you will be able to catch playing shows in Canada and the US this year in support of their current album ‘Better’. While episodes one and two of the show focused on singer songwriters Patrick Pentland and Rachel Raditz, the two March episodes we have for you shine lights on the rock world kicking off with a chaotic, hook-laden rip from singer/bassist Gina Kennedy, guitarist/singer Devon Lougheed and drummer Max Trefler. A wild and punchy performance very much in keeping with the spirit of the show. This series was created to document and further humanize the beauty and power of music. Raw, unfiltered and LIVE. Enjoy! The full episode can be found in the links section of the Phoebe St LIVE IG page below the Bio / on YouTube at ‘PhoebeStreetLIVE’! Subscribe to the channel to stay in the loop. Peace, love and live music, Rob Higgins (executive producer / host) director : JR Reid dop : Alex Chung sound engineer : Rob Sanzo mixing : Rob Higgins, Rob Sanzo editor : Nick Coleman colourist : Darrin Klimek, Accomplice Post Recorded and shot at Phoebe St Studio in Toronto. @phoebestreetstudio Sponsored by IN TECH Risk and Spy Cider House and Distillery. Proud, community-minded supporters of independent artists and makers. www.intechrisk.com www.spydistillery.com / @spydistillery @riverherbertjoggins @motioneer @spydistillery @alteredbymom @geenaweena @devonlougheed @maxtrefler @echo_cyp @robsanzo @seenickroute @accomplice_post #livemusic #studiosession #rock #music #studio](https://www.instagram.com/reel/DVYrCDqDfKu/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n\n# The Damingos Band Interview Newspaper 1974\n[[](https://www.instagram.com/faithkellyart) faithkellyart 433 New song Worse For Less played live on @wjffradio this past Saturday with @kgeary007 ! Listen to the full interview and performance on the archives and support public radio! This song will be the title track of the new album im writing. Can't wait to bring it to yall! Filmed by @caswynmoon 💙](https://www.instagram.com/reel/DVbRNpADe_7/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n[[](https://www.instagram.com/the_pretty_flowers) the_pretty_fl... 1,671 A look at the Never Felt Bitter LP and CD. Order at: forgeagainrecords.bandcamp.com/album/never-felt-bitter Upcoming shows Friday, March 27th at @healingforcerecords in Pasadena w/ @benjamingrey of Dear Boy solo set. Presented by @insonicdreams - Our Record Release Show 🥳 Saturday, April 4th @kensingtonclub1935 in San Diego w/ @rookiecardthemovie and @billyshaddox Thursday, April 9th @littlehilllounge in El Cerrito w/ @theeletterwriters Friday, April 10th @bigeasypetaluma in Petaluma w/ @redwoodchromeband Saturday, April 11 @thepartisanmerced in Merced w/ @_sloome69 and @bitterloa Sunday, April 12 @theknockoutsf in San Francisco w/ @the_goods_music and True Companion. Presented by @kxsfradio Friday, April 17th @ojaideerlodge in Ojai w/ @spireshq More info and tickets at theprettyflowers.net](https://www.instagram.com/reel/DV1Sps0DrKF/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n\n# The Damingos Band Interview Newspaper 1974\n[[](https://www.instagram.com/phoebestreetlive) phoebestreetlive 2,763 Phoebe St. LIVE is a new show recorded and shot @phoebestreetstudio in Toronto to document and further humanize the beauty and power of music. Raw, unfiltered and LIVE. We use a mix of vintage and new high-grade analog recording equipment to both record and mix the audio and a film crew of industry professionals use an equally powerful combination of cameras and lights to capture the visual part of the performance in a cinematic and engaging way. Episode four features up-and-coming Montreal garage rock duo, THE FLAMINGOS PINK. A band you might have caught on tour in Canada while they were out supporting their most recent release ‘GROWF’. A hooky, well-crafted EP that captures their sense of humour, passion and range. Acoustic-heavy and tongue-in-cheek track ‘Change Your Ways’ is an instant classic. I had the good fortune of being trusted with producing the songs for that recording at Phoebe St. Studio and I can tell you that those two guys put a lot of love and care into bringing them to life. And they dealt with each other in such a positive, constructive and respectful way while navigating the forever part of the process. It was inspiring. Their Phoebe St. LIVE set is some rock and roll catharsis driven by powerhouse vocals from guitarist Sacha Gubany while “off-the-wall” drummer and backing vocalist Julien Corrado drops a bass drum of death to bring the low end. An earnest and raucous performance in keeping with the spirit of the show. Enjoy! Peace, love and live music, Rob Higgins (executive producer / host) @riverherbertjoggins director/editor : JR Reid, Hands Editorial dop : Alex Chung sound engineer : Rob Sanzo mixing : Rob Higgins, Rob Sanzo lighting : John Pogue colourist : Darrin Klimek, Accomplice Post Support provided by INTECH Risk Management and Spy Cider House and Distillery. Proud, community-minded supporters of independent artists and makers.\n\n# The Damingos Band Interview Newspaper 1974\nwww.intechrisk.com www.spydistillery.com / @spydistillery @theflamingospink @buddy_jaxxen @julien.corrado @elel8743 @motioneer @handseditorial @echo_cyp @robsanzo @darrin_klimek @accomplice_post @jrcp71 #music #livemusic #studiosession #rock #artist](https://www.instagram.com/reel/DV8n0baDVbB/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n[[](https://www.instagram.com/poppyfieldmusic) poppyfieldmusic 1,440 New Poppyfield single “The Last Piece” coming out THIS FRIDAY March 27th!!!! Album coming soon :) 🧩🎶❤️](https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWSRHb3ASey/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n[[](https://www.instagram.com/jfinlin) jfinlin 137 New video for the outtakes record. \"Reject\" available on Bandcamp. Pay what you wish and enjoy...support the cause https://jefffinlin1.bandcamp.com/album/reject](https://www.instagram.com/reel/DVkFpvmDD4G/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n[[](https://www.instagram.com/fea210) fea210 2,111 Jenn and Phanie hanging in the studio. Noisy jackets or not—dance if you wanna dance. “Careful” drops April 3rd! Save the date. 👂🎶 Also, who the hell is putting out this record? That’s to come as well! #fea #fea210 #newsingle #newrecordlabel #careful](https://www.instagram.com/reel/DV9HdslJujO/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n\n# The Damingos Band Interview Newspaper 1974\n[[](https://www.instagram.com/justdandyband) justdandyband 360 Thanks to everyone who has checked out the EP. Big thank you to @drew.fantom for helping to produce this project, and @wesbreedwell for his vox at the end of this song. Big heart🖤🖤🖤](https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWAWum0D5wJ/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n[[](https://www.instagram.com/ash_acid_music) ash_acid_music 447 'LMN' feat. @daniellefedoruk is OUT in the big bad world THIS FRIDAY but just wanted to say a BIG THANK YOU to @chrispojama from @pbsfm and the legends @4zzzradio for getting in like Flynn and spinning it this week! You honestly have made my week. Long live community radio!! 🌹 #communityradio #lmn #4zzz #pbsfm 📸 @staircasecreativeau](https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWBjQd_CCyb/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n[[](https://www.instagram.com/cadillacnoonanmusic) cadillacnoona... 253 🚨She’s alive on the air! ‘Death of Me’ just got its first spin on Pure Rock 99.5 and we couldn’t be more stoked. 🚨 Massive shoutout to the crew for believing in the sound. Crank it loud, River Valley! 🤘 Thank you!! 🎸 #music #livemusic #rockandroll](https://www.instagram.com/reel/DVhcJEWj4Aa/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n[[](https://www.instagram.com/purplefunkmetropolis) purplefunkmet... 607 New PFM album on Friday the 13th 😈😈😈](https://www.instagram.com/reel/DVtJVb4CBkl/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\n\n# The Damingos Band Interview Newspaper 1974\n[[](https://www.instagram.com/reallynotradio) reallynotradio 188 Woooo weeee REALLY NOT RADIO SHOW 081025 is NOW STREAMING on Apple Music and Spotify✨🤩✨ This playlist took so long to build. I’m so pleased how it came together WOW 🤯🤯🤯✨🙏🏽✨ Black punk/rock will be mainstream soon BTW. Search ‘reallynotradio” or DM me and I’ll send you the link to listen ✨🥳✨🥇✨](https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWMqkszElJH/?utm_source=popular_topic_grid)\nGet the full experience\nSign up for Instagram\nMeta\nAbout\nBlog\nJobs\nHelp\nAPI\nPrivacy\nTerms\nLocations\nPopular\nInstagram Lite\nMeta AI\nMuse\nThreads\nContact Uploading & Non-Users\nMeta Verified\nEnglish\n© 2026 Instagram from Meta\n\n",
